<<else>>
	铁烤盘边沿烫到了你的小臂，面粉也扑了满袖口。<span class="red">烤炉热浪烫红了你的小臂。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "趁热刷上枫糖黄油 (0:06)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-bakery">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<span class="green">老街坊专为你的烘焙手艺而来。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_bakery")>><<money 420>><</if>>
