<<else>>
	细银针扎破了顶针旁边的指腹，你连忙捏住指尖免得血珠沾上白衬里。<span class="red">细针刺痛指腹，让你惊出一身冷汗。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "顺着拉弓弧度收紧内衬 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-tailor">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
