	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_tailor")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">细针刺痛指腹，让你惊出一身冷汗。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Followup Courier [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
夜莺街药房的老药剂师把一只贴着封条的红木药匣交到你手里，叮嘱道：「只有你跑腿从没颠碎过安瓿瓶，替我送去多瑙河街。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回跑腿驿站 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="job-fup-courier">
<<tendingicon>><<link "固定药匣疾行 (0:08)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-courier">>
