:: MP Job Followup Stable [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
那匹脾气最烈的栗色猎马一见你走进马厩便打了个响鼻，温顺地低下头蹭你的袖口。马夫笑着把新买的铜马镫交给你调试。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回郊外马厩 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="job-fup-stable">
<<tendingicon>><<link "替栗色猎马刷毛并调平马镫 (0:08)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-stable">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	猎马精神抖擞地在草场上跑了两圈，马主高兴地赏了你一笔驯马津贴。<span class="green">烈性猎马只听从你的安抚与调度。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_stable")>><<money 480>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	调试铜马镫时皮带扣夹了一下你的手心，留下一道红印。<span class="red">皮带铜扣夹痛了你的掌心。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "用熟牛油擦软硬的皮革肚带 (0:08)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-stable">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<span class="green">烈性猎马只听从你的安抚与调度。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_stable")>><<money 480>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">皮带铜扣夹痛了你的掌心。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Followup Trawler [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>>
拖网船出海前，老船长特意把副舵旁的风向标与主网纲交给你复查：「船上数你眼力最准，帮我看看今天外海的涌浪走向。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回拖网渔船甲板 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
