<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	拖网船避开暗礁满载而归，老船长在分红时给你多算了半份熟手红利。<span class="green">你的精准判断帮渔船大获丰收。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_trawler")>><<money 500>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	甲板摇晃，咸涩的浪花扑面打来迷了你的眼睛。<span class="red">咸冷海浪拍在脸上，震得手臂发酸。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "加固主网纲卸防止海沟挂网 (0:08)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-trawler">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11600 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	<span class="green">你的精准判断帮渔船大获丰收。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_trawler")>><<money 500>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">咸冷海浪拍在脸上，震得手臂发酸。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Keepsake Show Whistle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
你从贴身衣袋取出那枚在海蚀回音廊深处寻获的双锚纹守塔人铜哨。维斯目光一凝，接过铜哨翻看内壁刻字：「这是老港务长失踪前随身带的引航哨，有了它，暗港夜航船见哨如见人。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回维斯身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="ks-show-whistle">
<<investigateicon>><<link "请维斯试吹引航哨音暗码 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-whistle">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	维斯将铜哨穿上一根涂蜡海魂绳挂回你颈间。<span class="green">维斯为你解开了铜哨的引航暗码。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_whistle_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	海风吹晃防风灯，维斯先帮你将铜哨收好，约好等下次退潮再去核对暗礁。<span class="teal">维斯叮嘱你收紧铜哨挂绳。</span><<stress -1>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link "与他核对铜哨壁的暗礁航线 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-whistle">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	<span class="green">维斯为你解开了铜哨的引航暗码。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_whistle_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	<span class="teal">你们约好改日夜航再试吹暗码。</span><<stress -1>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Keepsake Show Core [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
你将机括城深处取出的发条擒纵游丝芯放在胡桃木柜台上。塞拉戴上单眼放大镜屏息端详：「这是百年前初代钟表匠手工淬火的蓝钢母芯，我找了整整三年！」
