	<span class="green">塞拉替你将机括母芯保养得完好如初。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_core_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	<span class="teal">塞拉叮嘱你切莫让游丝受潮。</span><<stress -1>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Keepsake Show Ring [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
你在防风灯下取出沉没修道院石龛里的银鸽指环。阿什托起你的手掌仔细辨认戒圈内侧的古符文：「这是早年守墓人与守林人互通消息的信物，戴着它，林间暗哨都会护你周全。」
